  "steps": [
    "Whisk the Protein yogurt, protein powder, sweetener, peanut butter, and a little water until smooth and fold in roasted salted peanuts.",
    "Pour evenly into 4 popsicle moulds. Freeze for 6–8 hours or overnight until fully set.",
    "Melt Bournville dark chocolate using a double boiler or microwave. Mix in sea salt.",
    "Demould popsicles and dip each into melted chocolate. Let excess drip off (roughly 1 spoon each side).",
    "Place on parchment paper and freeze for 5–10 minutes until chocolate sets. Enjoy in moderation."
